      "lines": [
        "任何一个数加正数就增大，而加负数则减小."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 1. 求 $-7$ 与 4 的和."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在数轴上用点 $A$ 表示 $-7$（图 76）. 当点 $A$ 向右移动 4 个",
        "单位时，它移到坐标为 $-3$ 的点 $B$. 也就是 $(-7)+4=-3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 76",
      "box": [
        183,
        508,
        1163,
        152
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-76"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 76",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 76"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 2. 求 $-2$ 与 $-4$ 二数的和."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们需要把点 $A(-2)$ 移动 $-4$ 个单位（图 77），也就"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 77",
      "box": [
        183,
        892,
        1171,
        156
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-77"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 77",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 77"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "是向左移 4 单位. 结果得点 $C(-6)$. 这就是：",
        "$(-2)+(-4)=-6$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假设上午温度变化 $4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，而下午变化 $-6^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. 就是说温度",
        "先升高 $4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，后下降 $6^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. 结果温度下降了 $2^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，也就是变化",
        "了 $-2^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. 数 $-2$ 是 4 与 $-6$ 二数的和（图 78）. $-2=4+(-6)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 78",
      "box": [
